  "storyId": "B-8451",
  "name": "deprecated-gc-audit-rule",
  "title": "Audit rule: count @deprecated annotations and surface cleanup advisory when threshold exceeded",
  "description": "Add a @deprecated GC cadence to the existing audit trigger. When the periodic audit fires (every N stories via auditTriggerWindow), also scan packages/main/src for @deprecated JSDoc annotations. If the count exceeds a configurable threshold (deprecatedGcThreshold, default 10), append a cleanup advisory to the audit hint output. This prevents legacy long-tail accumulation by surfacing the signal at audit time rather than requiring manual grep.",
